      "line": 674,
      "body": "### Keep the snapshot wire key independent of the receiving property\n\n**Severity:** `low`\n\nNon-blocking protocol clarity: `ReadSafeSnapshot` explicitly emits the JSON member `\"ViewerHwnd\"`. Use that stable member name for this lookup rather than deriving it from the receiving C# property. They are identical today; this avoids an unrelated property rename silently changing which JSON member is read. No current snapshot parsing failure or schema change is alleged.\n\n```suggestion\n        ViewerHwnd = snapshot[\"ViewerHwnd\"]!.GetValue<long>();\n```",
      "in_diff": true
    }
